{"id":"hz65tuwh3obq0f5ufhfocv3og","title":"NTNU团队开发新型仇恨言论检测工具，实现动态网络可视化与实时预警","originalTitle":"New tool maps and analyzes online hate speech","summary":"NTNU团队在《机器学习与知识提取》发表研究，开发工具可分析Facebook、Reddit等平台14,000条挪威及英语数据，识别涉及种族、性别认同、宗教或性取向的仇恨言论，并标注毒性等级。研究强调工具需结合人类反馈持续优化，目前正推进自动化实时检测功能。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Phys.org"},"links":{"original":"https://phys.org/news/2026-11-tool-online-speech.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-12T14:00:07.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-12T14:07:31.918Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-12T14:07:31.918Z","category":"ai-frontier","tags":["论文发表","研究成果"],"score":56,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"60a57775-ab56-4521-9a5d-ef801998bcdc","title":"NTNU团队开发动态网络可视化仇恨言论检测工具"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"60a57775-ab56-4521-9a5d-ef801998bcdc","title":"NTNU团队开发动态网络可视化仇恨言论检测工具"}],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"ftfQRbTpbzXA","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}